# 0.5: a line made ONLY of options names the token the
# author wrote. Every token on such a line is an option, so the positional list
# is empty and the keyword slot used to read `undefined`: the diagnostic said
# `"undefined" is not allowed in genre block`, naming nothing in the source.
# The keyword now falls back to the line's first token.
#
# Four paths, each of which printed `undefined` before: the genre allowlist in
# the content zone (line 15), the same allowlist after `layout` (line 18), the
# reserved `x-` prefix (line 16 — the first token is now seen, so the rule it
# actually breaks answers), and the no-genre path, where a header without a
# genre leaves no allowlist and the line falls through to `unrecognized line`
# (lines 20-21).
figdown 0.5 block
node a "A"
fill=red
x-foo=1
layout
stroke=blue

figdown 0.5
fill=red
